{"id":"f0cbb7d365d6e3cd","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-bijection-game.md","title":"有限轮双射卵石游戏","display":"df-bijection-game — 有限轮双射卵石游戏","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-bijection-game","aliases":["29-df-bijection-game"],"display":"df-bijection-game — 有限轮双射卵石游戏","depends_on":["[[29-df-pebble-game]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 12.22, p.189, DjVu scan 204","source_basis":"已核对文本层和页面图像；双射集合及有限回溯为本地形式化"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-bijection-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-bijection-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bijection-game — 有限轮双射卵石游戏"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da1408963eb3a178\" href=\"?note=da1408963eb3a178\" title=\"29-df-pebble-game\">29-df-pebble-game</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 12.22, p.189, DjVu scan 204"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"已核对文本层和页面图像；双射集合及有限回溯为本地形式化"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为非空有限结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>位置、原子合法性及覆盖更新取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da1408963eb3a178\" href=\"?note=da1408963eb3a178\" title=\"29-df-pebble-game\">29-df-pebble-game</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\)</span> 在下式指论域间的集合双射，不预设为结构同构。每轮先选卵石对，再由回应方选双射，最后挑战方选域中一点及其像。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\">\\(G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\)</span> 分别为下式引入的游戏数据及其初始空位置获胜谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi\\in|B|^{|A|}\\mid\n(\\forall a,a&#39;\\in|A|\\;(\\pi(a)=\\pi(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;))\\land\n(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;\\pi(a)=b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi\\in|B|^{|A|}\\mid\n(\\forall a,a&#39;\\in|A|\\;(\\pi(a)=\\pi(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;))\\land\n(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;\\pi(a)=b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{B,k,0}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^{A,B}_{B,k,0}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{B,k,r+1}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k}\\left(\\exists\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\;\n\\forall a\\in|A|\\;W^{A,B}_{B,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,\\pi(a))])\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^{A,B}_{B,k,r+1}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k}\\left(\\exists\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\;\n\\forall a\\in|A|\\;W^{A,B}_{B,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,\\pi(a))])\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),(W^{A,B}_{B,k,r})_{r\\leq m}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),(W^{A,B}_{B,k,r})_{r\\leq m}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.22，印刷页189、扫描页204，已视觉核对。双射在每轮重新选择，不要求预先固定全局同构；未移动的卵石及常量由更新后的原子一致性约束保留。零轮只检验当前位置，不检验域大小；正轮遇到不同域大小时双射集合为空，回应方失败。递归按轮数良基。选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|A|\">\\(a\\in|A|\\)</span> 已允许挑战全部双射配对，故不需要再重复一个逆向分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-pebble-game","status":"resolved","id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-pebble-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-pebble-game","status":"resolved","id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"位置、原子合法性及覆盖更新取 [[29-df-pebble-game]]；$p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m,r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi\\in|B|^{|A|}\\mid\n(\\forall a,a'\\in|A|\\;(\\pi(a)=\\pi(a')\\to a=a'))\\land\n(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;\\pi(a)=b)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{B,k,0}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{B,k,r+1}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k}\\left(\\exists\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)\\;\n\\forall a\\in|A|\\;W^{A,B}_{B,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,\\pi(a))])\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),(W^{A,B}_{B,k,r})_{r\\leq m}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{bij}}_{k,m}(A,B)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{B,k,m}(\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\in|A|","display":false}],"bytes":2161,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]、[[29-df-bijection-game]]、[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]、[[29-thm-counting-bijection]] — 计数与双射游戏"},{"id":"3f7769b0fc6d1261","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-bijection-game]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-bijection-game|29-df-bijection-game]]"}],"outgoing":["da1408963eb3a178"]}